AB  - This article explores how Artificial Intelligence (AI), particularly tools like ChatGPT, is transforming the ways people write and learn English. It examines how AI-powered language models assist learners in improving grammar, vocabulary, and fluency, while also enhancing creativity and confidence in writing. The study discusses the advantages of using AI as a personalized tutor, editor, and conversation partner, as well as potential challenges such as overreliance and accuracy issues. By analyzing both educational and technological perspectives, the article highlights how AI is reshaping English language learning and writing practices in academic, professional, and everyday contexts.
